/RJ01337000/RJ01336113_img_main_240x240.jpg", "samples": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01337000/RJ01336113_img_smp1.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01337000/RJ01336113_img_smp2.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01337000/RJ01336113_img_smp3.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01337000/RJ01336113_img_smp4.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01337000/RJ01336113_img_smp5.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01337000/RJ01336113_img_smp6.jpg"], "sample_thumbs": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01337000/RJ01336113_img_smp1_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01337000/RJ01336113_img_smp2_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01337000/RJ01336113_img_smp3_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01337000/RJ01336113_img_smp4_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01337000/RJ01336113_img_smp5_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01337000/RJ01336113_img_smp6_100x100.jpg"], "alt": "罠のダンジョンへようこそ! [Sinister]"}, "introductions": [{"type": "text", "title": "内容 (Content)", "body": [{"intro": "あなたはエース、罠の専門家。ある日、ダンジョンを探索していると、同じギルドの女騎士トリシャと遭遇する。彼女は罠にかかって身動きが取れず、助けを求めている。最初は助けようとするが、彼女のエロイ体を見た瞬間、どうしても我慢できなくなり……そして、今まで一度もしたことのない行動を決意する──。<br />\r\n<br />\r\nこのゲームにはビジュアルノベルがあります。ビジュアルノベルパートをクリアすると、ゲーム内のすべてのLive2Dシーンにアクセスできます。<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou are Ace, a specialist in traps. One day, while exploring dungeons, you encounter Trisha, a knight from the same guild as you. She is stuck in a trap and begs you to help her. At first, you try to help her, but because of her erotic body, you cannot bear it and decide to do something you’ve never done before...<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game has a visual novel. After finishing the visual novel part, you can access all Live2D scenes in the game."}]